WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.970
In 2024, the National
Assembly was dissolved.

2
00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.900
In the first round, the «Rassemblement
National» and its allies

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.600
won the most votes.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.530
Then many candidates
withdrew to block them,

5
00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.690
and they came third in seats.

6
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:17.240
Yet the party's own group
is still the largest

7
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.190
single group in the Assembly.

8
00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:22.210
It began tiny, in 1972.

9
00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:23.950
How did it get there?

10
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:27.810
In this mission, you'll compare
what parties propose on immigration,

11
00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:33.010
from «la priorité nationale» to
regularising undocumented workers.

12
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.540
Then you'll follow the
party along a timeline,

13
00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:39.200
dot by dot, and set out
both sides of the debate.

14
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.000
Your mission: trace the party's rise,

15
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.710
name each party's policies,
and explain how it got there.
